{"seq":59,"slug":"bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter","title":"贝叶斯优化与超参数搜索","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter","rating":{"composite":4.35,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 贝叶斯优化与超参数搜索\n\n当一次模型训练需要数小时甚至数天，而待调参数横跨学习率、批量大小、正则化强度、网络深度等十几个维度时，穷举式搜索在计算上完全不可行。贝叶斯优化提供了一条根本不同的路径：用概率代理模型（surrogate model）逼近真实目标函数的全局形态，再通过采集函数（acquisition function）在不确定性最大和预期收益最高的区域之间做出决策，每次只执行最有信息价值的那一次评估。这种\"用统计模型替代暴力搜索\"的范式，使得在数十次而非数千次试验内找到接近最优的配置成为可能。\n\n本 hub 从数学基础出发，依次建立代理模型、采集函数和探索-利用权衡的理论框架，然后介绍序贯模型优化（SMBO）、TPE/BOHB、多保真度方法等核心算法族，接着覆盖搜索空间设计、早停调度和分布式并行等工程关键环节，最后落到 Optuna/Ax 平台实操、神经架构搜索以及工业应用案例。\n\n学习路径推荐：先读「基础」章节建立高斯过程与采集函数的直觉，再进入「算法」章节理解 SMBO/TPE/多保真度的实现差异，之后带着对算法的认知去「超参数工程」章节解决真实项目中的搜索空间和并行问题，最终在「实战」章节把所有知识落地到具体平台和场景。\n\n前置知识：概率论基础（高斯分布、条件概率）、基本的机器学习训练流程（损失函数、验证集评估）、Python 编程经验。如果对核函数和边缘似然不熟悉，建议先阅读高斯过程的入门材料。\n\n本 hub 与相邻主题的分工边界：optimization-theory 聚焦凸优化与数学规划的通用理论（梯度法、对偶性、KKT 条件）；bayesian-statistics 处理贝叶斯推断的一般框架（先验/后验/MCMC）；bayesian-data-analysis 关注贝叶斯方法在数据分析中的应用（层次模型、模型比较）。本 hub 专注于将贝叶斯推断应用于黑箱优化这一特定场景，其核心问题是\"如何用最少的昂贵评估找到最优超参数配置\"。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"surrogate-model-gp","title":"代理模型与高斯过程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/foundations/surrogate-model-gp"},{"seq":2,"slug":"acquisition-functions","title":"采集函数设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/foundations/acquisition-functions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"exploration-exploitation","title":"探索与利用平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/foundations/exploration-exploitation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithms","title":"核心算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sequential-model-based","title":"序贯模型优化（SMBO）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/algorithms/sequential-model-based"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tree-parzen-estimators","title":"TPE 与 BOHB","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/algorithms/tree-parzen-estimators"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-fidelity-methods","title":"多保真度方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/algorithms/multi-fidelity-methods"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"hyperparameter","title":"超参数工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"search-space-design","title":"搜索空间设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter/search-space-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"early-stopping-scheduling","title":"早停与调度策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter/early-stopping-scheduling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"distributed-parallel-search","title":"分布式并行搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter/distributed-parallel-search"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实战应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"optuna-ax-platform","title":"Optuna 与 Ax 平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/practice/optuna-ax-platform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"neural-architecture-search","title":"神经架构搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/practice/neural-architecture-search"},{"seq":3,"slug":"real-world-applications","title":"工业应用案例","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/practice/real-world-applications"}]}]}